          <groundspeak:finder id="18277262">deepwoodsdogs</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP240 Huggett. I had never heard of Huggett before now but now I can say I was there. A drive thru some farmland unfamiliar to myself was worth the trip to catch up to this brass cap. TFTC!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
