        <groundspeak:log id="440199129">
          <groundspeak:date>2014-08-27T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="228846">Mr. CanoeHead</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP240 Huggett

It was a bit of a trek off the main route back to this one but it was our first cap of the day and we were fresh and up for it.  This was a humbling cap for me as I was challenged on my assessment of the what the crop was.  I made a declaration that resulted in the vehicle being turned around and a close examination made of the crop that surrounded the cap and I was again proven wrong.  Hey, I never claimed to be a farmer ... I am a Canoehead!   TFTCap&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
